                "description": "<h2>Create Feedback</h2><p>Submits new feedback for a session or business idea. Requires User Role.</p><h3>Request Body</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Required</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>content</code></td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>The textual feedback.</td></tr><tr><td><code>rating</code></td><td>integer</td><td>Yes</td><td>Rating from 1 to 10.</td></tr><tr><td><code>timestamp</code></td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>Creation timestamp.</td></tr><tr><td><code>sessID</code></td><td>integer</td><td>No</td><td>Associated consultancy session ID.</td></tr><tr><td><code>ideaID</code></td><td>integer</td><td>No</td><td>Associated business idea ID. (Either sessID or ideaID must be provided).</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Responses</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Status</th><th>Description</th><th>Body</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>201 Created</code></td><td>Feedback created successfully.</td><td><code>{\"message\": \"feedback created successfully\"}</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>400 Bad Request</code></td><td>Missing required fields.</td><td><code>{\"message\": \"missing fields\"}</code></td></tr></tbody></table>"
